SYNTHESIS
  Simultaneous peel should be read as a signed order ledger, not as an absolute tail.
  Consecutive/AP far blocks have low-height relation rank and large individual order terms,
  but their order signs often oppose; separated far blocks are already close to P_r.
  The sharp proof obligation is a rank-sensitive packet estimate for each order sum
  Sigma_{|S|=s}(Delta_S-Phi_s), with exact low-height relations routed to finite scale atlases.
  High orders do not vanish; the useful claim is geometric apex-prime suppression plus signs.

